# Names only, and every one of them optional.
#
# Values come from the Supabase project and are set in the host: Lovable for
# the application, GitHub Actions secrets for the workflows, the function
# secrets for the edge functions. No secret is in this repository and none
# should be.
#
# The two the browser needs are the exception, and deliberately: the project
# URL and the publishable key are defaulted in src/lib/erp.ts so that a build
# with no environment at all still reaches a project. They were only ever in a
# tracked .env, and when that left version control every publish shipped an
# application whose first screen asked the visitor to set them. Setting them
# here still wins, which is how a preview points somewhere else.
VITE_SUPABASE_URL=
VITE_SUPABASE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY=
VITE_SUPABASE_PROJECT_ID=
SUPABASE_URL=
SUPABASE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY=
SUPABASE_PROJECT_ID=
